* Nexperia SPICE models, fetched 2026-10-07 from https://assets.nexperia.com/documents/spice-model/<PART>.txt
* Subckt pin order: 1 = collector, 2 = base, 3 = emitter (per Nexperia convention).
* Q2 / RQ / D1 are modelling aids (quasi-saturation, reverse mode), not physical devices.
* BCP56_16 extraction 17/2022, BC847B 24/2021, BC817_40 42/2018, BC807_40 49/2018, BCP53_16 25/2019 - all with temperature dependency.
*
.SUBCKT BCP56_16 1 2 3
Q1 1 2 3 MAIN 0.9101
Q2 11 2 3 MAIN 0.08992
RQ 1 11 50
D1 2 1 DIODE
.MODEL MAIN NPN
+ IS = 8.811E-14 NF = 0.9954 ISE = 1.113E-14 NE = 1.52 BF = 142 IKF = 0.6416 VAF = 8
+ NR = 0.9943 ISC = 2.266E-14 NC = 1.361 BR = 35.83 IKR = 1.883 VAR = 81
+ RB = 10.4 IRB = 0.0011 RBM = 2.5 RE = 0.0864 RC = 0.09966 XTB = 0.6022 EG = 1.11 XTI = 6.507
+ CJE = 1.442E-10 VJE = 0.7013 MJE = 0.3245 TF = 7.8E-10 XTF = 7 VTF = 5 ITF = 2 PTF = 0
+ CJC = 2.052E-11 VJC = 0.5 MJC = 0.4015 XCJC = 1 TR = 2.3E-08 CJS = 0 VJS = 0.75 MJS = 0.333 FC = 0.9
.MODEL DIODE D
+ IS = 1.323E-14 N = 0.9814 BV = 1000 IBV = 0.001 RS = 3185 CJO = 0 VJ = 1 M = 0.5 FC = 0 TT = 0 EG = 1.11 XTI = 3
.ENDS
*
.SUBCKT BCP53_16 1 2 3
Q1 1 2 3 MAIN 0.7456
Q2 11 2 3 MAIN 0.2544
RQ 1 11 9
D1 1 2 DIODE
.MODEL MAIN PNP
+ IS = 1.01E-13 NF = 1.006 ISE = 7.054E-15 NE = 1.3 BF = 157.5 IKF = 1 VAF = 15.62
+ NR = 1.006 ISC = 1.406E-14 NC = 1.325 BR = 13.46 IKR = 0.86 VAR = 80
+ RB = 10 IRB = 0.001 RBM = 2.5 RE = 0.1363 RC = 0.006969 XTB = 1.779 EG = 1.11 XTI = 5.698
+ CJE = 1.049E-10 VJE = 0.7623 MJE = 0.3879 TF = 1.115E-09 XTF = 2.02 VTF = 3.118 ITF = 0.759 PTF = 0
+ CJC = 4.998E-11 VJC = 0.9968 MJC = 0.4942 XCJC = 1 TR = 6.5E-08 CJS = 0 VJS = 0.75 MJS = 0.333 FC = 0.8944
.MODEL DIODE D
+ IS = 1.162E-15 N = 0.9998 BV = 1000 IBV = 0.001 RS = 8226 CJO = 0 VJ = 1 M = 0.5 FC = 0 TT = 0 EG = 1.11 XTI = 3
.ENDS
*
.SUBCKT BC847B 1 2 3
