+ CJE = 1.264E-11 VJE = 0.7056 MJE = 0.3401 TF = 6.258E-10 XTF = 25 VTF = 2 ITF = 0.277 PTF = 0
+ CJC = 3.624E-12 VJC = 0.5036 MJC = 0.365 XCJC = 1 TR = 1.55E-07 CJS = 0 VJS = 0.75 MJS = 0.333 FC = 0.78
.MODEL DIODE D
