*
* BAT54 Nexperia Schottky, extraction 28/2020. Pins: 1 = anode, 2 = cathode. R1 is a reverse-mode modelling aid.
.SUBCKT BAT54 1 2
R1 1 2 1.8E+07
D1 1 2 DIODE1
.MODEL DIODE1 D
+ IS = 2.117E-07 N = 1 BV = 56 IBV = 0.0005 RS = 2.7 CJO = 8E-12 VJ = 0.09 M = 0.31 FC = 0.5 TT = 0 EG = 0.69 XTI = 2
.ENDS
